the team currently produce, and how much of that is assembled manually versus built into the system itself?*", "company_website": "https://www.moneylion.com", "company_about": "Mobile finance app bundling borrowing, saving, investing, and credit-building, including personal loans, cash advances, checking, and credit monitoring.", "industry_group": "Consumer Finance / Personal Finance App", "missing_pointers": ["location", "linkedin_url"]}
