t for HIPAA-governed healthcare infrastructure. A good opening question for a rep: *When a billing or coverage API call fails silently in production today, what does your team's process look like for tracing it back to the root cause?*", "company_website": "https://www.cedar.com", "company_about": "Healthcare financial platform that unifies billing, payments, insurance coverage, and patient support to improve collections and the patient payment experience.", "industry_group": "Healthcare Payments / RCM", "missing_pointers": ["location", "linkedin_url"]}
