r Intelligence, how does your team currently handle request-level observability, and where do the biggest blind spots tend to show up in production?*", "company_website": "https://www.cedar.com", "company_about": "Healthcare financial platform that unifies billing, payments, insurance coverage, and patient support to improve collections and the patient payment experience.", "industry_group": "Healthcare Payments / RCM", "missing_pointers": ["location", "linkedin_url"]}
