ite's API-driven architecture, observability and structured request logging become operational necessities, not afterthoughts. A strong opening question for a rep: *As Health Catalyst scales the Ignite platform and onboards more health systems onto its API layer, how does your engineering team currently handle request-level visibility and debugging when issues arise in production?*", "company_website": "https://www.healthcatalyst.com", "company_about": "Healthcare data-and-analytics company that unifies data and applies AI-powered insights to drive measurable clinical, financial, and operational improvement for provider organizations.", "industry_group": "Healthcare Data & Analytics", "missing_pointers": ["location", "linkedin_url"]}
